      font-size: 0.95rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      outline: none;
      /* The content field's wrapper is styled like the other field labels, at
         weight 600. The editor inherited that, so Chrome reported every
         selection as already bold (it treats >=600 as bold) and the Bold button
